    {
      "number": 216,
      "title": "Model name change randomly",
      "state": "OPEN",
      "author": {
        "login": "mkandeel0"
      },
      "labels": [],
      "comments": 1,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-30T13:40:10Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-30T20:32:21Z",
      "body": "After sending a couple of prompts (2-3) the model name changes from `github-copilot:claude-opus-5.5` to `github-copilot:claude-opus-5-5`\n\nSo I have to reselect/change the model again",
